<% content_for :title, "About" %>
<div class="container--narrow">
  <h1>About Larkspur</h1>
  <p>Larkspur is a small, focused tool for hosts: design a digital invitation, send it to your guest list, and keep track of who's coming — without asking guests to sign up for anything.</p>
  <h2>How guest data is handled</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Guests open their invitation through a private link that only works for them. Links are signed, never indexed, and can be revoked.</li>
    <li>Guest contact details are visible only to the event's host and co-hosts with guest-list access, and are filtered out of our logs.</li>
    <li>Guests can stop emails about an event at any time. Deleting an event deletes its guest list and responses.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
